Looking at the scores of ways to cheat your way to high points, it seems
pointless to try for the highest score.  But what about the quickest ascent?
Seems the fastest would be: get good armor, weapon, cursed scroll of teleport,
RoTC early on, tele to Dlvl 50, find wiz, kill wiz by stoning, and run for
the endgame.  Haven't tried it yet.

David
BTW: Quickest so far:around 41000 turns.

PS: Yes, this means just before you sacrifice the AoY to your god, check you
